      "html": "<p>This attractive tetra was imported from Venezuela for the first time. Currently 12 species of Bryconops are described from Venezuela, but most of them are known from preserved specimens only, so the determination is only tentative.</p><p>The fish are very pretty. They are supposed to reach a maximum length of about 6-7 cm; the imported fish are currently 4-5 cm long.</p>"
